            "review_title": "Review at Baek Jeong Korean BBQ Restaurant",
            "review_text": "준혁 안\n5 contributions\n0\nGreat atmosphere for a family meal, great food and good service\nJul 2023 • Family\nWe were able to have a special family dinner in a room that could fit 12 people on the second floor in a cozy and comfortable atmosphere. It was even better that the lively and friendly servers provided attentive service. Satisfied with the taste, atmosphere, and service!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 19, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
