            "review_title": "Review at Baek Jeong Korean BBQ Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Perfect-Chaos-007\nDaejeon, South Korea81 contributions\n0\nKorean food? Really?\nJan 2019 • Friends\nAnother dining joint owned by a korean celeb.\n\nDull tasting and tough texture pork.\n\nBeef fared better in taste but not properly stored in the freezer as the meats had mild frost-burnt texture.\n\nKimchi? Don’t think it’ll satisfy anyone who really knows a good kimchi.\n\nBest on the menu?\nCoca-cola and Mirinda Orange.\n\nAt least the waiting staff were fairly better than other large dining establishments in service quality; we tipped for better service, and frequently.\nRead more\nWritten January 25, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
