            "review_text": "yeunju\n103 contributions\n0\nFine meat\nFeb 2016 • Friends\nI went to the one in my Dinh Songda near the manor in nam tu Liem. my friends and I went for the meat haha~ It was very good quality with various selections. The layout and setting was superb. I love the outer rim of the fry pan because it includes steamed egg, cheese with corn, and an empty area for cooked stuff. \n\nThe price was not cheap, but definitely had lots of veggies and sides. I really liked their ddeok gochi, which is ricecake on a stick with red pepperpaste.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2016",
